ss="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-12" href="#C_Price_Trends" >c. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="Price Trends">Price Trends</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-13" href="#D_Timing_of_Procurement" >d. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="Timing of Procurement">Timing of Procurement</span></a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-14" href="#Precautions" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="Precautions">Precautions</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-15" href="#Conclusion" >結論</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-16" href="#Reference" >参照</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Nutritional_Composition"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="Nutritional Composition">Nutritional Composition</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="To understand kidney beans">To understand kidney beans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="it&#8217;s important to first know their nutritional components">it&#8217;s important to first know their nutritional components</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans are a nutrient-rich food">Kidney beans are a nutrient-rich food</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="containing various beneficial nutrients for the human body">containing various beneficial nutrients for the human body</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="According to different sources">According to different sources</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="the nutritional composition of kidney beans is as follows">the nutritional composition of kidney beans is as follows</span>:</p><ul><li><strong>タンパク質</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans have a high protein content">Kidney beans have a high protein content</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="typically between">typically between</span> 20% そして 30%. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="the protein content of large white kidney beans is">the protein content of large white kidney beans is</span> 19.94%, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="which is">which is</span> 5% に 10% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="higher than wheat and">higher than wheat and</span> 12% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="higher than corn">higher than corn</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="Red kidney beans contain">Red kidney beans contain</span> 22.53 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="grams of protein per">grams of protein per</span> 100 グラム.</li><li><strong>脂肪</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="The fat content of kidney beans is low">The fat content of kidney beans is low</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="usually between">usually between</span> 1% そして 2%. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="red kidney beans contain only">red kidney beans contain only</span> 1.06 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="grams of fat per">grams of fat per</span> 100 グラム.</li><li><strong>炭水化物</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans have a high carbohydrate content">Kidney beans have a high carbohydrate content</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="generally between">generally between</span> 55% そして 62%. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="red kidney beans contain">red kidney beans contain</span> 61.3 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="grams of carbohydrates per">grams of carbohydrates per</span> 100 グラム.</li><li><strong>食物繊維</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans are a high-fiber food">Kidney beans are a high-fiber food</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="with red kidney beans containing">with red kidney beans containing</span> 15.2 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="grams of dietary fiber per">grams of dietary fiber per</span> 100 グラム. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="They also contain resistant starch and insoluble fiber">They also contain resistant starch and insoluble fiber</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="which help promote digestive health">which help promote digestive health</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="Vitamins and Minerals">Vitamins and Minerals</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans are rich in various vitamins and minerals">Kidney beans are rich in various vitamins and minerals</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="such as vitamin A">such as vitamin A</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="B vitamins">B vitamins</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="vitamin C">vitamin C</span>, ビタミンe, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="vitamin K">vitamin K</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="vitamin P">vitamin P</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="as well as calcium">as well as calcium</span>, 鉄, 亜鉛, カリウム, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="sodium">sodium</span>, マグネシウム, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="and phosphorus">and phosphorus</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="Notably">Notably</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="their calcium and iron content is seven times and four times that of chicken">their calcium and iron content is seven times and four times that of chicken</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="respectively">respectively</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="In daily life">In daily life</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="we should also consume more low-fat">we should also consume more low-fat</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="high-fiber foods as they offer numerous health benefits">high-fiber foods as they offer numerous health benefits</span>.</p><figure id="attachment_545-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-545-2" style="width: 676px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/speckled-kidney-beans-300x207.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-545" alt="speckled kidney beans" width="686" height="473" title="インゲン豆は体に良いですか での分析aly側面6 Aspects 5" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-545-2" class="wp-caption-text">斑点のあるインゲン豆</figcaption></figure><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Low-Fat_Benefits"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="Low-Fat Benefits">Low-Fat Benefits</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="Cardiovascular Health">Cardiovascular Health</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="A low-fat diet helps lower cholesterol levels in the blood">A low-fat diet helps lower cholesterol levels in the blood</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="reducing the risk of cardiovascular diseases">reducing the risk of cardiovascular diseases</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="Weight Management">Weight Management</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="Low-fat foods aid in weight control since they typically provide fewer calories">Low-fat foods aid in weight control since they typically provide fewer calories</span>.</li></ul><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="High-Fiber_Benefits"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="High-Fiber Benefits">High-Fiber Benefits</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="Digestive Promotion">Digestive Promotion</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="High-fiber foods increase intestinal motility">High-fiber foods increase intestinal motility</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="preventing constipation and improving digestive health">preventing constipation and improving digestive health</span>.</li><li><strong>血糖コントロール</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="Dietary fiber helps slow the rise in blood sugar levels">Dietary fiber helps slow the rise in blood sugar levels</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="which is particularly beneficial for diabetics">which is particularly beneficial for diabetics</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="Cholesterol Reduction">Cholesterol Reduction</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="Dietary fiber can bind bile acids and promote their excretion">Dietary fiber can bind bile acids and promote their excretion</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="thus lowering cholesterol levels in the blood">thus lowering cholesterol levels in the blood</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="Weight Loss">Weight Loss</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="High-fiber foods can increase satiety">High-fiber foods can increase satiety</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="reducing overall food intake and assisting with weight loss">reducing overall food intake and assisting with weight loss</span>.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Are_kidney_beans_good_for_you"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="Are kidney beans good for you">Are kidney beans good for you</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans are not only nutrient-rich but also offer various health benefits">Kidney beans are not only nutrient-rich but also offer various health benefits</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="making them a recommended healthy food choice">making them a recommended healthy food choice</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="These benefits include support for cardiovascular health">These benefits include support for cardiovascular health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="blood sugar control">blood sugar control</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="digestive system health">digestive system health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="and weight loss">and weight loss</span>.</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="Cardiovascular Health">Cardiovascular Health</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans are low in fat">Kidney beans are low in fat</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="high in fiber">high in fiber</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="high in potassium">high in potassium</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="high in magnesium">high in magnesium</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="and low in sodium">and low in sodium</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="These characteristics help lower blood pressure">These characteristics help lower blood pressure</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="blood lipids">blood lipids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="and cholesterol levels">and cholesterol levels</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="improve blood circulation">improve blood circulation</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_112" data-source="" data-orig="and prevent arteriosclerosis and coronary heart disease">and prevent arteriosclerosis and coronary heart disease</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_113" data-source="" data-orig="antioxidants like vitamin C in kidney beans can protect vascular endothelial cells from free radical damage">antioxidants like vitamin C in kidney beans can protect vascular endothelial cells from free radical damage</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_114" data-source="" data-orig="maintaining the elasticity and health of blood vessels">maintaining the elasticity and health of blood vessels</span>.</li><li><strong>血糖コントロール</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_115" data-source="" data-orig="The alpha-amylase inhibitors in kidney beans can slow down the breakdown of carbohydrates">The alpha-amylase inhibitors in kidney beans can slow down the breakdown of carbohydrates</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_116" data-source="" data-orig="helping diabetics manage blood sugar fluctuations">helping diabetics manage blood sugar fluctuations</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_117" data-source="" data-orig="Studies have shown that white kidney bean extract can effectively reduce postprandial blood glucose response">Studies have shown that white kidney bean extract can effectively reduce postprandial blood glucose response</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_118" data-source="" data-orig="which is excellent news for diabetics">which is excellent news for diabetics</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_119" data-source="" data-orig="The glycemic index">The glycemic index</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_120" data-source="" data-orig="GI">GI</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_121" data-source="" data-orig="of kidney beans is about">of kidney beans is about</span> 24, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_122" data-source="" data-orig="meaning they have a minimal impact on blood sugar levels">meaning they have a minimal impact on blood sugar levels</span>.</li><li><strong>消化器系の健康</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_123" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans are rich in dietary fiber">Kidney beans are rich in dietary fiber</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_124" data-source="" data-orig="promoting gastrointestinal motility and aiding digestion and absorption">promoting gastrointestinal motility and aiding digestion and absorption</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_125" data-source="" data-orig="They contain significant amounts of resistant starch">They contain significant amounts of resistant starch</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_126" data-source="" data-orig="alpha-galactosidase">alpha-galactosidase</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_127" data-source="" data-orig="and insoluble fiber">and insoluble fiber</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_128" data-source="" data-orig="which can act as prebiotics">which can act as prebiotics</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_129" data-source="" data-orig="promoting the proliferation of beneficial gut bacteria and producing short-chain fatty acids that support health">promoting the proliferation of beneficial gut bacteria and producing short-chain fatty acids that support health</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_130" data-source="" data-orig="Weight Loss Support">Weight Loss Support</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_131" data-source="" data-orig="The saponins in kidney beans promote fat metabolism">The saponins in kidney beans promote fat metabolism</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_132" data-source="" data-orig="and their dietary fiber content increases satiety">and their dietary fiber content increases satiety</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_133" data-source="" data-orig="reducing the intake of other foods">reducing the intake of other foods</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_134" data-source="" data-orig="Regular consumption of white kidney beans can aid in weight loss">Regular consumption of white kidney beans can aid in weight loss</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_135" data-source="" data-orig="white kidney bean extract inhibits the activity of amylase">white kidney bean extract inhibits the activity of amylase</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_136" data-source="" data-orig="reducing the breakdown of starch foods into glucose">reducing the breakdown of starch foods into glucose</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_137" data-source="" data-orig="thereby lowering calorie intake and helping control body fat">thereby lowering calorie intake and helping control body fat</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_138" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans offer significant benefits in promoting cardiovascular health">Kidney beans offer significant benefits in promoting cardiovascular health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_139" data-source="" data-orig="controlling blood sugar">controlling blood sugar</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_140" data-source="" data-orig="improving digestive system health">improving digestive system health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_141" data-source="" data-orig="and supporting weight loss">and supporting weight loss</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="_Cooking_and_Consumption_Methods"></span> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_142" data-source="" data-orig="Cooking and Consumption Methods">Cooking and Consumption Methods</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_143" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans are a nutrient-rich and versatile ingredient">Kidney beans are a nutrient-rich and versatile ingredient</span>, <span class