6-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-546-2" style="width: 684px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/Black-Kidney-Beans-300x202.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-546" alt="Black Kidney Beans" width="694" height="467" title="インゲン豆は体に良いですか? での分析 6 側面 6" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_425" data-source="" data-orig="Black Kidney Beans" data-hidden="y"></span><figcaption id="caption-attachment-546-2" class="wp-caption-text"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_225" data-source="" data-orig="Black Kidney Beans">Black Kidney Beans</span></figcaption></figure><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Demand_Trends"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_226" data-source="" data-orig="Demand Trends">Demand Trends</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_227" data-source="" data-orig="Global Market Growth">Global Market Growth</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_228" data-source="" data-orig="According to data from">According to data from</span> 2023, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_229" data-source="" data-orig="the global kidney bean market was approximately">the global kidney bean market was approximately</span> $7.9 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_230" data-source="" data-orig="billion">billion</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_231" data-source="" data-orig="expected to reach">expected to reach</span> $12.2 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_232" data-source="" data-orig="billion by">billion by</span> 2032, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_233" data-source="" data-orig="with a compound annual growth rate">with a compound annual growth rate</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_234" data-source="" data-orig="CAGR">CAGR</span>) の 4.5%. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_235" data-source="" data-orig="This indicates that the global kidney bean market will continue to grow over the next decade">This indicates that the global kidney bean market will continue to grow over the next decade</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_236" data-source="" data-orig="Rapid Growth in the Chinese Market">Rapid Growth in the Chinese Market</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_237" data-source="" data-orig="The Chinese market has experienced rapid changes in recent years">The Chinese market has experienced rapid changes in recent years</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_238" data-source="" data-orig="with its market size accounting for a certain proportion of the global market in">with its market size accounting for a certain proportion of the global market in</span> 2023, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_239" data-source="" data-orig="and is expected to increase significantly by">and is expected to increase significantly by</span> 2030. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_240" data-source="" data-orig="This highlights China&#8217;s importance in the global kidney bean market">This highlights China&#8217;s importance in the global kidney bean market</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_241" data-source="" data-orig="Price Fluctuations">Price Fluctuations</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_242" data-source="" data-orig="Recently">Recently</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_243" data-source="" data-orig="the price of kidney beans has risen">the price of kidney beans has risen</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_244" data-source="" data-orig="for instance">for instance</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_245" data-source="" data-orig="in the Jiaxing region">in the Jiaxing region</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_246" data-source="" data-orig="where prices increased from">where prices increased from</span> 10 元to 15 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_247" data-source="" data-orig="yuan per pound">yuan per pound</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_248" data-source="" data-orig="Such price fluctuations may affect market demand and consumer purchasing behavior">Such price fluctuations may affect market demand and consumer purchasing behavior</span>.</li></ul><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Target_Consumer_Group_Analysis"