egarded as a</span> &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_261" data-source="" data-orig="weight loss tool">weight loss tool</span>,&#8221; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_262" data-source="" data-orig="making them popular among health-conscious consumers">making them popular among health-conscious consumers</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_263" data-source="" data-orig="This group typically has higher requirements regarding the nutritional value and health benefits of foods">This group typically has higher requirements regarding the nutritional value and health benefits of foods</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_264" data-source="" data-orig="Brand Awareness">Brand Awareness</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_265" data-source="" data-orig="Consumer awareness of market brands is also an important factor influencing purchasing decisions">Consumer awareness of market brands is also an important factor influencing purchasing decisions</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_266" data-source="" data-orig="Some brands">Some brands</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_267" data-source="" data-orig="such as Bearkoko">such as Bearkoko</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_268" data-source="" data-orig="have performed exceptionally well in the white kidney bean snack market">have performed exceptionally well in the white kidney bean snack market</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_269" data-source="" data-orig="demonstrating high competitiveness and recognition">demonstrating high competitiveness and recognition</span>.</li></ul><p>全体, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_270" data-source="" data-orig="the current market demand for kidney beans is steadily increasing">the current market demand for kidney beans is steadily increasing</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_271" data-source="" data-orig="particularly in the Chinese market">particularly in the Chinese market</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_272" data-source="" data-orig="Target consumer groups include individuals of varying income levels">Target consumer groups include individuals of varying income levels</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_273" data-source="" data-orig="different ages">different ages</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_274" data-source="" data-orig="and health-conscious consumers">and health-conscious consumers</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_275" data-source="" data-orig="all of whom show high acceptance of white kidney beans and related products">all of whom show high acceptance of white kidney beans and related products</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Procurement_Recommendations"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_276" data-source="" data-orig="Procurement Recommendations">Procurement Recommendations</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="A_How_to_Choose_Quality_Kidney_Beans"></span>a. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_277" data-source="" data-orig="How to Choose Quality Kidney Beans">How to Choose Quality Kidney Beans</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_278" data-source="" data-orig="Pod Fullness">Pod Fullness</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_279" data-source="" data-orig="High-quality kidney beans should have plump">High-quality kidney beans should have plump</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_280" data-source="" data-orig="juicy pods">juicy pods</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_281" data-source="" data-orig="If the pods break without fibrous strings">If the pods break without fibrous strings</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_282" data-source="" data-orig="it indicates higher freshness">it indicates higher freshness</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_283" data-source="" data-orig="Color and Shine">Color and Shine</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_284" data-source="" data-orig="Select kidney beans that are brightly colored">Select kidney beans that are brightly colored</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_285" data-source="" data-orig="free of spots">free of spots</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_286" data-source="" data-orig="and feel smooth overall">and feel smooth overall</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_287" data-source="" data-orig="Vibrant">Vibrant</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_288" data-source="" data-orig="shiny kidney beans typically indicate better quality">shiny kidney beans typically indicate better quality</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_289" data-source="" data-orig="Skin and Pest Damage">Skin and Pest Damage</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_290" data-source="" data-orig="The skin of high-quality kidney beans should be smooth without signs of pest damage">The skin of high-quality kidney beans should be smooth without signs of pest damage</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_291" data-source="" data-orig="If there are signs of insect damage">If there are signs of insect damage</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_292" data-source="" data-orig="they should not be purchased">they should not be purchased</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_293" data-source="" data-orig="Aroma and Taste">Aroma and Taste</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_294" data-source="" data-orig="Quality kidney beans should have a normal aroma and taste">Quality kidney beans should have a normal aroma and taste</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_295" data-source="" data-orig="If they have a sour or moldy smell">If they have a sour or moldy smell</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_296" data-source="" data-orig="they are of poor quality and should not be purchased">they are of poor quality and should not be purchased</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_297" data-source="" data-orig="Texture">Texture</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_298" data-source="" data-orig="When touched">When touched</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_299" data-source="" data-orig="quality kidney beans should feel full and soft">quality kidney beans should feel full and soft</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_300" data-source="" data-orig="in contrast">in contrast</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_301" data-source="" data-orig="shriveled">shriveled</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_302" data-source="" data-orig="hollow beans with signs of pests should not be chosen">hollow beans with signs of pests should not be chosen</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_303" data-source="" data-orig="By using these criteria">By using these criteria</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_304" data-source="" data-orig="one can select high-quality kidney beans">one can select high-quality kidney beans</span>.</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="B_Supply_Chain_and_Logistics_Considerations"></span>b. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_305" data-source="" data-orig="Supply Chain and Logistics Considerations">Supply Chain and Logistics Considerations</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_306" data-source="" data-orig="Supply chain management for kidney beans is crucial and involves multiple aspects such as procurement">Supply chain management for kidney beans is crucial and involves multiple aspects such as procurement</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_307" data-source="" data-orig="transportation">transportation</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_308" data-source="" data-orig="and sales">and sales</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_309" data-source="" data-orig="To ensure efficient supply chain operations">To ensure efficient supply chain operations</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_310" data-source="" data-orig="consider adopting digital transformation and smart upgrade strategies">consider adopting digital transformation and smart upgrade strategies</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_311" data-source="" data-orig="such as the use of blockchain technology">such as the use of blockchain technology</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_312" data-source="" data-orig="to enhance data security">to enhance data security</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_313" data-source="" data-orig="privacy protection">privacy protection</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_314" data-source="" data-orig="and facilitate industry collaboration and compliance">and facilitate industry collaboration and compliance</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_315" data-source="" data-orig="establishing centralized warehouses can effectively improve supply chain efficiency and reduce overall costs">establishing centralized warehouses can effectively improve supply chain efficiency and reduce overall costs</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_316" data-source="" data-orig="For imported dried kidney beans">For imported dried kidney beans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_317" data-source="" data-orig="comprehensive supply chain services are needed">comprehensive supply chain services are needed</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_318" data-source="" data-orig="including overseas pickup">including overseas pickup</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_319" data-source="" data-orig="international logistics">international logistics</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_320" data-source="" data-orig="customs clearance">customs clearance</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_321" data-source="" data-orig="bonded transit">bonded transit</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_322" data-source="" data-orig="and domestic logistics">and domestic logistics</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_323" data-source="" data-orig="These services help businesses better manage the logistics process for imported kidney beans">These services help businesses better manage the logistics process for imported kidney beans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_324" data-source="" data-orig="ensuring smooth delivery to the destination">ensuring smooth delivery to the destination</span>.</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="C_Price_Trends"></span>c. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_325" data-source="" data-orig="Price Trends">Price Trends</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_326" data-source="" data-orig="Data from multiple sources indicates that kidney bean prices have been on the rise in recent years">Data from multiple sources indicates that kidney bean prices have been on the rise in recent years</span>. 例えば, で 2024, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_327" data-source="" data-orig="the price of kidney beans was">the price of kidney beans was</span> 3.11 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_328" data-source="" data-orig="yuan per pound">yuan per pound</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_329" data-source="" data-orig="an increase compared to the previous day">an increase compared to the previous day</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_330" data-source="" data-orig="the price of flower kidney beans on August">the price of flower kidney beans on August</span> 24, 2024, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_331" data-source="" data-orig="was">was</span> 12.0 キログラムあたりの元. 全体, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_332" data-source="" data-orig="kidney bean prices are significantly influenced by the upstream industry and have been gradually rising as upstream prices increase">kidney bean prices are significantly influenced by the upstream industry and have been gradually rising as upstream prices increase</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_333" data-source="" data-orig="Prices of kidney beans vary by region and market">Prices of kidney beans vary by region and market</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_334" data-source="" data-orig="in the Zibo area">in the Zibo area</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_335" data-source="" data-orig="the wholesale price of kidney beans was">the wholesale price of kidney beans was</span> 3.50 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_336" data-source="" data-orig="yuan per pound">yuan per pound</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_337" data-source="" data-orig="an increase of">an increase of</span> 1.20 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_338" data-source="" data-orig="yuan per pound compared to the same period last week">yuan per pound compared to the same period last week</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_339" data-source="" data-orig="marking a rise of">marking a rise of</span> 52.17%. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_340" data-source="" data-orig="Such price fluctuations require purchasers to closely monitor market dynamics to adjust procurement strategies promptly">Such price fluctuations require purchasers to closely monitor market dynamics to adjust procurement strategies promptly</span>.</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="D_Timing_of_Procurement"></span>d. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_341" data-source="" data-orig="Timing of Procurement">Timing of Procurement</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_342" data-source="" data-orig="The planting and harvesting of kidney beans exhibit clear seasonal characteristics">The planting and harvesting of kidney beans exhibit clear seasonal characteristics</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_343" data-source="" data-orig="in some regions">in some regions</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_344" data-source="" data-orig="large quantities of kidney bean pods are available in late July">large quantities of kidney bean pods are available in late July</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_345" data-source="" data-orig="allowing purchasers to buy in bulk to secure quality and price advantages">allowing purchasers to buy in bulk to secure quality and price advantages</span>. したがって, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_346" data-source="" data-orig="procuring during these seasonal peaks is a good choice">procuring during these seasonal peaks is a good choice</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_347" data-source="" data-orig="By analyzing historical price data and market forecasts">By analyzing historical price data and market forecasts</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_348" data-source="" data-orig="one can better grasp the timing of procurement">one can better grasp the timing of procurement</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_349" data-source="" data-orig="market analysis reports suggest that kidney bean prices may continue to rise in the coming years">market analysis reports suggest that kidney bean prices may continue to rise in the coming years</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_350" data-source="" data-orig="so it is advisable to make large purchases when prices are relatively low to lock in costs">so it is advisable to make large purchases when prices are relatively low to lock in costs</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Precautions"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_351" data-source="" data-orig="Precautions">Precautions</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><figure id="attachment_547-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-547-2" style="width: 715px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/red-Kidney-Beans-1-300x173.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-547" alt="red Kidney Beans" width="725" height="418" title="インゲン豆は体に良いですか? での分析 6 側面 7" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_426" data-source="" data-orig="red Kidney Beans" data-hidden="y"></span><figcaption id="caption-attachment-547-2" class="wp-caption-text"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_352" data-source="" data-orig="red Kidney Beans">red Kidney Beans</span></figcaption></figure><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_353" data-source="" data-orig="Here are some precautions regarding the consumption of kidney beans">Here are some precautions regarding the consumption of kidney beans</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_354" data-source="" data-orig="Cook Thoroughly">Cook Thoroughly</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_355" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans contain natural toxins">Kidney beans contain natural toxins</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_356" data-source="" data-orig="such as lectins and saponins">such as lectins and saponins</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_357" data-source="" data-orig="which can cause poisoning reactions">which can cause poisoning reactions</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_358" data-source="" data-orig="including nausea">including nausea</span>, 嘔吐, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_359" data-source="" data-orig="and abdominal pain if not cooked thoroughly">and abdominal pain if not cooked thoroughly</span>. したがって, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_360" data-source="" data-orig="kidney beans must be fully cooked before consumption">kidney beans must be fully cooked before consumption</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_361" data-source="" data-orig="Moderate Consumption">Moderate Consumption</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_362" data-source="" data-orig="Overeating any food is not beneficial for health">Overeating any food is not beneficial for health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_363" data-source="" data-orig="and kidney beans should also be consumed in moderation">and kidney beans should also be consumed in moderation</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_364" data-source="" data-orig="Excessive intake may cause digestive discomfort or gastrointestinal issues">Excessive intake may cause digestive discomfort or gastrointestinal issues</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_365" data-source="" data-orig="It is recommended that adults consume">It is recommended that adults consume</span> 30-50 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_366" data-source="" data-orig="grams of legumes per day">grams of legumes per day</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_367" data-source="" data-orig="Special Population Cautions">Special Population Cautions</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_368" data-source="" data-orig="Pregnant women">Pregnant women</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_369" data-source="" data-orig="breastfeeding mothers">breastfeeding mothers</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_370" data-source="" data-orig="and children should consume kidney beans under medical guidance">and children should consume kidney beans under medical guidance</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_371" data-source="" data-orig="Those with poor digestive function or chronic gastrointestinal diseases should limit or avoid kidney beans">Those with poor digestive function or chronic gastrointestinal diseases should limit or avoid kidney beans</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_372" data-source="" data-orig="Individuals allergic to kidney beans should avoid consumption altogether">Individuals allergic to kidney beans should avoid consumption altogether</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_373" data-source="" data-orig="Avoid Raw Consumption">Avoid Raw Consumption</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_374" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans should not be eaten raw or undercooked">Kidney beans should not be eaten raw or undercooked</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_375" data-source="" data-orig="as this can lead to toxin residue">as this can lead to toxin residue</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_376" data-source="" data-orig="causing diarrhea and vomiting">causing diarrhea and vomiting</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_377" data-source="" data-orig="Pairing Considerations">Pairing Considerations</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_378" data-source="" data-orig="Combining kidney beans with certain foods may affect their nutritional value or cause discomfort">Combining kidney beans with certain foods may affect their nutritional value or cause discomfort</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_379" data-source="" data-orig="kidney beans should not be consumed with coffee">kidney beans should not be consumed with coffee</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_380" data-source="" data-orig="as caffeine can destroy vitamin B1 found in kidney beans">as caffeine can destroy vitamin B1 found in kidney beans</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_381" data-source="" data-orig="Seasonal Considerations">Seasonal Considerations</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_382" data-source="" data-orig="The period around the frost is a high-risk time for kidney bean poisoning">The period around the frost is a high-risk time for kidney bean poisoning</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_383" data-source="" data-orig="as the beans at this time are thicker-skinned and larger">as the beans at this time are thicker-skinned and larger</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_384" data-source="" data-orig="making them harder to cook and having relatively higher toxin levels">making them harder to cook and having relatively higher toxin levels</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_385" data-source="" data-orig="Extra caution is advised">Extra caution is advised</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_386" data-source="" data-orig="By adhering to these precautions">By adhering to these precautions</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_387" data-source="" data-orig="one can better enjoy the health benefits of kidney beans while avoiding potential health risks">one can better enjoy the health benefits of kidney beans while avoiding potential health risks</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Conclusion"></span>結論<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_388" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans are a nutrient-rich ingredient with numerous health benefits">Kidney beans are a nutrient-rich ingredient with numerous health benefits</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_389" data-source="" data-orig="First">First</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_390" data-source="" data-orig="kidney beans are rich in protein">kidney beans are rich in protein</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_391" data-source="" data-orig="dietary fiber">dietary fiber</span>, ビタミン, そしてミネラル, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_392" data-source="" data-orig="which contribute significantly to human health">which contribute significantly to human health</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_393" data-source="" data-orig="the dietary fiber in kidney beans helps regulate blood sugar">the dietary fiber in kidney beans helps regulate blood sugar</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_394" data-source="" data-orig="promotes intestinal health">promotes intestinal health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_395" data-source="" data-orig="and enhances satiety">and enhances satiety</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_396" data-source="" data-orig="which can aid in weight loss">which can aid in weight loss</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_397" data-source="" data-orig="the saponins in kidney beans can assist in reducing fat absorption and promoting fat metabolism">the saponins in kidney beans can assist in reducing fat absorption and promoting fat metabolism</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_398" data-source="" data-orig="thereby aiding in weight loss">thereby aiding in weight loss</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_399" data-source="" data-orig="Kidney beans also help regulate gut flora and promote intestinal health">Kidney beans also help regulate gut flora and promote intestinal health</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_400" data-source="" data-orig="Their resistant starch and alpha-galactosidase contribute to a prebiotic effect">Their resistant starch and alpha-galactosidase contribute to a prebiotic effect</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_401" data-source="" data-orig="promoting the proliferation of beneficial gut bacteria">promoting the proliferation of beneficial gut bacteria</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_402" data-source="" data-orig="which in turn produces healthy short-chain fatty acids">which in turn produces healthy short-chain fatty acids</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_403" data-source="" data-orig="the high potassium">the high potassium</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_404" data-source="" data-orig="high magnesium">high magnesium</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_405" data-source="" data-orig="and low sodium content of kidney beans help lower cholesterol levels in the blood">and low sodium content of kidney beans help lower cholesterol levels in the blood</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_406" data-source="" data-orig="preventing cardiovascular diseases">preventing cardiovascular diseases</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_407" data-source="" data-orig="In terms of market prospects">In terms of market prospects</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_408" data-source="" data-orig="multiple market research reports indicate a good development potential for the kidney bean industry in the coming years">multiple market research reports indicate a good development potential for the kidney bean industry in the coming years</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_409" data-source="" data-orig="the">the</span> &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_410" data-source="" data-orig="Analysis of the Development Status of the Chinese Kidney Bean Industry and Future Prospect Research Report">Analysis of the Development Status of the Chinese Kidney Bean Industry and Future Prospect Research Report</span> (2024-2031)&#8221; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_411" data-source="" data-orig="points out that with the increasing health awareness among consumers and the growing demand for natural foods">points out that with the increasing health awareness among consumers and the growing demand for natural foods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_412" data-source="" data-orig="the kidney bean market is expected to continue to grow">the kidney bean market is expected to continue to grow</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_413" data-source="" data-orig="changes in the supply-demand relationship and shifts in consumption structure in both global and Chinese markets also indicate that the kidney bean industry will maintain stable growth in the coming years">changes in the supply-demand relationship and shifts in consumption structure in both global and Chinese markets also indicate that the kidney bean industry will maintain stable growth in the coming years</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_414" data-source="" data-orig="Purchasing kidney beans not only offers numerous health benefits">Purchasing kidney beans not only offers numerous health benefits</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_415" data-source="" data-orig="such as weight loss">such as weight loss</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_416" data-source="" data-orig="fat reduction">fat reduction</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_417" data-source="" data-orig="and blood supplementation">and blood supplementation</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_418" data-source="" data-orig="but from a market perspective">but from a market perspective</span>, インゲン豆, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_419" data-source="" data-orig="as a nutrient-rich ingredient">as a nutrient-rich ingredient</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_420" data-source="" data-orig="have broad development space and market potential in the future">have broad development space and market potential in the future</span>. したがって, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_421" data-source="" data-orig="from both health and economic viewpoints">from both health and economic viewpoints</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_422" data-source="" data-orig="purchasing kidney beans is a wise choice">purchasing kidney beans is a wise choice</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Reference"></span><strong>参照</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_423" data-source="" data-orig="Analysis of the Current Development Status and Future Prospects of the Chinese Bean Industry">Analysis of the Current Development Status and Future Prospects of the Chinese Bean Industry</span> (2024-2031)</strong>. (2024).</p>`} />
